<p>The United States and Iran offered sharply different casualty accounts after Israeli and American strikes on Iranian targets, followed by Iranian retaliation against US facilities in the Middle East. The US said it had received “no reports” of American casualties. Iran’s Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC), cited by Iran’s Tasnim news agency, said Iranian missile strikes on US bases in the region killed or injured at least 200 US military personnel. It also warned President Donald Trump that Iran is prepared for a prolonged conflict. Separately, the Iranian Red Crescent Society said Israeli and US strikes on Iran killed 201 people and injured 747.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Trigger described: RT said President Trump confirmed White House support for Israel’s strikes, pointing to the failure of nuclear diplomacy as the trigger.</li><li>Force involvement: DW said the operation drew on a wide range of personnel, “from the army to the coast guard”.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>US government (as reported by DW): The US said it had “no reports” of American casualties. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/iran-strikes-us-says-no-reports-of-american-casualties/a-76169908'>DW</a>)</li><li>Iran’s IRGC (as reported by RT): The IRGC said Iran is ready for a prolonged conflict and warned President Donald Trump that Iran has “advanced capabilities”. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/633217-iran-strikes-hundreds-american-soldiers/'>RT</a>)</li><li>Iranian Red Crescent Society (as reported by AP): The Iranian Red Crescent Society said Israeli and American strikes on Iran killed and injured civilians. (<a href='https://apnews.com/live/live-updates-israel-iran-february-28-2026'>AP News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/iran-strikes-us-says-no-reports-of-american-casualties/a-76169908'>Iran strikes: US says &#x27;no reports&#x27; of American casualties</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/633217-iran-strikes-hundreds-american-soldiers/'>US military suffered 200 casualties in retaliatory strikes – Tehran</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://apnews.com/live/live-updates-israel-iran-february-28-2026'>The Iranian Red Crescent Society reports 201 people have been killed and 747 others have been injured so far in Israeli and American strikes on Iran.</a> - apnews.com</li></ul>